              "text": "The Indiana Pacers **did not qualify** for the 2026 NBA playoffs. \n\nThe Pacers finished the 2025\u201326 regular season with a **19\u201363 record** (14th in the Eastern Conference), making them the first team in the league to be mathematically eliminated from playoff contention on March 10, 2026. \n\nThe disappointing season came on the heels of their 2025 NBA Finals run. Their struggles were primarily due to a devastating rash of injuries, most notably a season-ending torn Achilles tendon suffered by star point guard Tyrese Haliburton during Game 7 of the 2025 Finals, which sidelined him for the entire 2025\u201326 campaign.",
